==Battleground==
*7 [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*7 [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plate]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

